 "changed": {
  "31:oeddat ti isio": "source M LEGO oeddat ti isio siarad split like seed 1 (dw i isio + siarad) so the frame is its own unit and siarad reuses",
  "32:oeddat ti isio": "source relied on older-seed oeddat ti isio; same frame LEGO as seed 31",
  "33:pa mor hir": "weave-dropped seed; built from source-old splits pa mor hir + wyt ti ’di bod yn dysgu",
  "35:dydy hi ddim isio": "source relied on older dydy hi ddim + isio; one frame LEGO parallel to seed 34 dydy o ddim isio",
  "36:dan ni ddim isio": "source relied on older seeds for the frame; shortest unit, parallel to dan ni isio (18)",
  "37:meddwl": "source relied on older-seed meddwl",
  "38:am tua wythnos": "am, tua, wythnos untiled (older seeds); Korean takes 일주일 정도 as one unit",
  "39:bore ’ma": "source had bore only (’ma from older seeds); one LEGO parallel to pnawn ’ma",
  "41:blino": "source relied on older-seed blino; dw i’n + dechrau already taught",
  "42:o’n i’n": "o’n, i’n untiled (older seeds); shortest frame 나는 ~하고 있었어",
  "42:teimlo’n well na": "source well na left teimlo’n untiled; Korean ~보다 기분이 나아지다 is one unit",
  "43:do’n i ddim yn": "source-old LEGO do’n i ddim yn meddwl split so meddwl reuses (seed 37)",
  "43:am": "am untiled (older seeds); shortest LEGO ~에 대해",
  "45:dw i ddim angen": "source-old dw i ddim left angen untiled; one frame LEGO 나는 ~ㄹ 필요가 없어",
  "47:fod o’n beth da i": "the i was untiled (older seeds); joined to the frame, Korean ~하는 것이",
  "49:ti’n": "ti’n untiled (older seeds); shortest frame 너는 ~해, parallel to dw i’n",
  "50:mor gyflym â phosib": "source-old mor gyflym left â phosib untiled; one LEGO parallel to mor aml â phosib (3)",
  "51:gwneud": "gwneud untiled (older seeds)",
  "51:fy ffrindiau": "fy, ffrindiau untiled (older seeds); one unit 내 친구들",
  "52:ei ffrind": "ei untiled; source-old ffrind joined, Korean 그의 친구",
  "52:wythnos diwetha’": "wythnos, diwetha’ untiled; one unit 지난주 parallel to mis diwetha’",
  "54:rhoi ychydig mwy o amser": "Popty counts it over 8 syllables; split into rhoi + ychydig mwy o amser (#813·AK)",
  "55:mwynhau": "dw i’n mwynhau was one LEGO in 51; mwynhau alone needed after dw i ddim yn",
  "57:be’": "be’ untiled (older seeds); shortest LEGO 무엇",
  "58:mae’n ddiddorol": "source-old mae’n + ddiddorol; one unit parallel to mae’n ddefnyddiol (28)",
  "58:digon o eiriau": "source digon left o eiriau untiled; Korean 충분한 단어 is one unit",
  "59:wneud": "gwneud untiled (older seeds); same LEGO as 51"
